The current implementation does `store.value = store.value + 1` synchronously, which:
1. Reads a Promise object (not the actual value)
2. Adds 1 to it (coercing to a number, which is NaN)
3. Sets that back

The fix needs to:
1. Await the current value (async read)
2. Set the new value (which queues a microtask)
